WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.674
Performance should come after correctness A faster
query that changes

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:11.506
row grain or NULL behavior is not an improvement
Write the clearest correct

00:00:11.532 --> 00:00:17.283
query first Then inspect the execution plan and
consider rewrites

00:00:17.296 --> 00:00:22.863
or indexes Whenever you rewrite a subquery compare
the result

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:23.771
sets carefully
